1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:01,317
We won't have a lot of time to talk,

2
00:00:01,400 --> 00:00:06,157
because we'll be cruising over the ground
station at 17,500 miles an hour.

3
00:00:06,240 --> 00:00:08,417
That's 25 times the speed of sound.

4
00:00:08,500 --> 00:00:09,597
So we'll actually only have

5
00:00:09,680 --> 00:00:11,557
about 9 or 10 minutes
of good radio contact

6
00:00:11,640 --> 00:00:13,780
from the horizon to the horizon.

